flowchart TD
    A[Writing or regenerating a .bib file] --> B{Hand-editing an<br/>existing entry?}
    B -->|Yes| B1[STOP — these are generated.<br/>Regenerate from source instead]
    B1 --> C
    B -->|No| C[Gather the source data]

    C --> C1["Portfolio-info file:<br/>title wording, keywords"]
    C1 --> C2["project-live-urls.json:<br/>candidate URLs"]
    C2 --> C3["git log --reverse / npm registry:<br/>real first-release year"]
    C3 --> D[Probe every candidate URL]

    D --> D1{200 / 301?}
    D1 -->|No| D2[Omit that channel.<br/>Probe beats the data file]
    D1 -->|"403 on npmjs.com"| D3["Bot protection, not dead —<br/>confirm via registry.npmjs.org"]
    D2 --> E
    D3 --> E
    D1 -->|Yes| E[Choose the entry type]

    E --> E1{What is the work?}
    E1 -->|"Software: app, package,<br/>CLI, extension"| E2["@misc<br/>(lands as ORCID 'Other')"]
    E1 -->|Paper / book / thesis| E3[Use the matching real type]
    E2 --> F
    E3 --> F[Write the fields]

    F --> F1["title = {{Name}}: descriptor<br/>inner braces protect the name"]
    F1 --> F2["author = {Mahmood, Ahsan}<br/>Last, First"]
    F2 --> F3["year = real first-release year"]
    F3 --> F4["url = single main link"]
    F4 --> F5["note = channels that are actually live"]
    F5 --> G[Citation key]

    G --> G1{Key already imported<br/>to ORCID?}
    G1 -->|Yes| G2[Keep it byte-identical.<br/>Renaming creates a duplicate]
    G1 -->|No| G3["aoneahsan-&lt;slug&gt;-&lt;year&gt;"]
    G2 --> H
    G3 --> H[Write files]

    H --> H1["One &lt;slug&gt;.bib per project"]
    H1 --> H2["Regenerate the combined file<br/>in the SAME edit"]
    H2 --> V[Verify]

    V --> V1[["🔴 ASCII check:<br/>decode('ascii') must not raise"]]
    V1 --> V2[Braces balanced]
    V2 --> V3[Keys unique across the corpus]
    V3 --> V4[Entry count under ~50]
    V4 --> I{Import succeeds?}

    I -->|No| I1[Bisect: import the<br/>per-project files to find<br/>the offending entry]
    I1 --> F
    I -->|Yes| DONE([Done — then retype<br/>in the ORCID UI])

    style B1 fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#c90
    style V1 fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c00
    style DONE fill:#e0f0e0,stroke:#0a0
